# NOTE: public/build is intentionally gitignored (it's generated by `npm run build`).
# It must NOT be excluded from the Docker build context (no .dockerignore entry for it)
# and must be generated during the image build (see Dockerfile / railway.json buildCommand)
# so the compiled Vite assets (manifest.json, app-*.css, app-*.js) are present at runtime.
